    "notes": "Mahmud ibn Sebüktegin became the first fully independent ruler of the Ghaznavid dynasty and reigned from 998 until his death in 1030, building a major military empire from eastern Iran and Central Asia into the Punjab. ATLAS uses the familiar canonical form Mahmud of Ghazni and the Ghaznavid Empire polity."
